phase: P2
dispatch_plan: {mode: static-batch, batches: [{id: auth-token-parser, complexity: medium, tests_filter: "python -m pytest tests/auth/test_token.py -q"}]}
---
body
$ FILE=<tmp>/P2-design.md python3 agate/scripts/agate-md-field-get.py dispatch_plan
EXIT_CODE: 0
--- STDOUT ---
{"mode": "static-batch", "batches": [{"id": "auth-token-parser", "complexity": "medium", "tests_filter": "python -m pytest tests/auth/test_token.py -q"}]}
合法 JSON: True ; batches[0].tests_filter='python -m pytest tests/auth/test_token.py -q' ; 与写入值逐字节相同: True
CONCLUSION BDD-1: PASS

##### BDD-2 #####
_gate_p2_dispatch_plan(含 tests_filter) -> None
_gate_p2_dispatch_plan(删去全部 tests_filter) -> None
_gate_p2_dispatch_plan(对照：含 tests_filter 但缺 complexity) -> "dispatch_plan batch 'b1' 的 complexity 非法（当前: None），须 ∈ low/medium/high"
CONCLUSION BDD-2: PASS (含/不含 tests_filter 均返回 None；对照组缺 complexity 仍被拒，证明只是未知键被忽略而非 fail-open)

